PLASTICO — MASTER BUILD PROMPT

Build a Premium, Complete Arabic Plastics Industry Platform

You are acting as a senior product designer, UX/UI architect, brand designer, and expert full-stack React developer.

Your task is to design and build PLASTICO (بلاستيكو) — a complete, premium, multi-page digital platform dedicated to the plastics manufacturing industry across Egypt and the Arab world.

This is not a simple landing page, a static template, or a visual demo made of non-functional cards.

Build a real, structured, responsive web application with multiple pages, clear navigation, realistic industrial content, working forms, search, filters, dashboards, profiles, and interactive workflows.

The platform must connect everyone in the plastics industry:

- Technicians and machine operators.
- Engineers and technical specialists.
- Factory owners and production managers.
- Raw material suppliers.
- Machinery and spare-parts suppliers.
- Industrial equipment traders.
- Customers looking for factories to manufacture their plastic products.
- Factories offering manufacturing and production services to third parties.

The most important addition is a full Manufacturing Services & Contract Manufacturing Marketplace that connects customers who need plastic products manufactured with factories that have the machines, molds, technical capabilities, and available production capacity.

The final result must feel like a high-quality international industrial SaaS platform, not a generic business website.

