2. PRODUCT VISION

PLASTICO is a specialized digital ecosystem for the plastics industry.

Its purpose is to bring the entire industry into one organized platform.

A technician should be able to find work, publish machine problems, learn from other technicians, and build a professional reputation.

An engineer should be able to display their specialization, experience, technical skills, and professional achievements.

A factory owner should be able to publish jobs, showcase the factory, find suppliers, advertise available manufacturing capacity, and receive manufacturing requests.

A supplier should be able to present materials, machinery, spare parts, and industrial products.

A trader should be able to advertise used machines, molds, and equipment.

A customer should be able to find a suitable factory to manufacture a plastic product, operate an existing mold, or provide a specific manufacturing service.

PLASTICO must serve as a professional meeting point between the people, factories, products, equipment, and services of the plastics industry.

Primary market:

- Egypt.

Expansion markets:

- Saudi Arabia.
- United Arab Emirates.
- Kuwait.
- Other Arab countries.

Build the platform so that adding more countries, currencies, cities, and languages later is straightforward.

